build/
*.o
*.a
# Core dumps only — anchored, because an unanchored `core` also matches the
# DIRECTORY src/core/, which silently kept the whole pipeline driver
# (arena.c, compile.c, sb.c, internal.h) out of every commit. A fresh clone
# of this repo did not build until M2.8 caught it.
/core
/core.*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tests/fuzz/failures/

# The session hand-off brief: deliberately NOT project record, so it must not
# be committed. It was, twice, on 2026-08-10 — `git add -A -- docs` stages it,
# and the previous session's brief warned about exactly that in prose. A rule
# a tool enforces beats a rule a comment states.
/docs/wake.md
